# ignore specific txt files, but keep requirements.txt and runtime.txt
# NOTE: media/ is intentionally NOT ignored — it holds the course
# material .txt files (DBMS.txt, Information Systems.txt) that
# index_text_files.py needs to build the knowledge base. Without
# these committed, Render's build has nothing to index.
PROJECT_SUMMARY.txt
*.txt
!requirements.txt
!runtime.txt
!media/*.txt